  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You conjure a demonic warglaive and hurl it at a creature or object in range. Make a ranged spell attack against it. On a hit, the target takes 1d8 Slashing damage plus 1d8 Fire damage, and the glaive rebounds toward another target of your choice within 30 feet of it; make new attack and damage rolls against that target.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The Fire damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 1. The glaive can rebound a number of times equal to the level of the spell slot, and each creature can be targeted only once per casting.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-khoEoTVSGIKMuSwo\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Use <em>Rebound</em> for each new target, choosing the level you cast the spell at.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
